{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The doctor said, \u201cYou\u2019re ill. Endless visions will haunt you. No one knows when you\u2019ll recover. But one day, I will save you.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>She thought, Sounds kind of fun.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DREAMiLL\u00a0</strong>is an adventure game where a young girl and her pet wander a world that defies reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide her through exploration and puzzles, and see for yourself what ending waits at the edge of dreams and delusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678780/extras/e80f453b3f6811085847332f48635bdf.poster.avif?t=1762501201\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678780/extras/e80f453b3f6811085847332f48635bdf.webm?t=1762501201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world before her is pure unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects and people alike are strange, unfamiliar things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your key to progress is <strong>knowledge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s simple: just as you would on a trip, snap a photo of anything that catches your eye to <i>record</i> it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the &quot;connection&quot; between records and reality may pave the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201c\u2026and that\u2019s the setup. So\u2014interested yet?\u201d</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678780?t=1